  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the tangent to the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math> which is parallel to the line <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math> is"
  },
